A note on the human-subject data

These records come from human participants who consented to their responses
being released publicly in de-identified form. The licence grants broad reuse
rights, but it does not waive the ethical obligations that come with the data:

  - Do not attempt to re-identify participants, whether alone or by linking
    these records against any other dataset.
  - The demographic fields are quasi-identifiers and the free-text answers are
    participants' own writing. Treat both accordingly.

See the Ethics and consent section of README.md for what participants were told.
